  "D": "if u_b = u_a - C + E then the (A,B) loop of {a,b} equals the (C,E) loop of (u_a,u_b); when (C,E) has size 2, Theorem A there gives t_ab = s_a s_b (|rho_CE|^2 - p_ua p_ub - p_va p_vb) / (2 sigma_1 sigma_2), which is RATIONAL because the monomial M = (r_a r_b)^2 cancels identically"
